{"version":1,"content":"<p>為應對日益嚴重的軌道擁堵問題，英國航天局宣佈向ClearSpace UK授予價值6100萬英鎊（約合8100萬美元）的合同，用於設計、建造和測試專門的太空垃圾清理航天器。這項任務計劃在2029年至2032年期間執行，目標是在近地軌道移除兩顆已經失去功能的英國衞星。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583438.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.593682+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"e37a9880d485a6215a5f4768d793cc038972f5a28b0416fbbbe38286a6d6f578","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}